{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfkLPCxCNLMuRZy7RfX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've stopped scrolling. Here's how it went.\n\n**What I decided:** Nothing for sure. I'm leaning toward Altshuler Shaham's S&P 500 track (עוקב מדד S&P 500, number 14865). I'm \"unsure\", not more. What decided it is that I know the name Altshuler from ads, and its \"דמי ניהול\" of 0.54% was the lowest I noticed. It also shows 100% מניות and 100% מט\"ח, which I take to mean \"it's really the S&P\". But I'm not buying anything today. 143 tracks across 12 companies, and they all look the same.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** The heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\", with \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" already picked. I saw \"143 מסלולים של 12 חברות\" and the row of buttons (כלל 143, עוקב מדד s&p 500 12…). I didn't touch any of them. The orange box I skipped; it looked like a notice.\n- **Screens 2–7:** I scrolled the table with my thumb and looked only at track names, the big fee % and the big return %.\n  - The first S&P 500 track I saw was 13414: 0.56% fee, \"13.7%\" over 3 years. That number stuck with me.\n  - After that I passed the company bars for מור, אנליסט, מיטב and אלטשולר שחם.\n  - At Altshuler the S&P track shows \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a return. I didn't get why.\n- **Screens 8–14:** Skipped.\n- **Screen 15:** I jumped to the bottom to see if there was a summary or a recommendation. There's only \"עוד לא דווח\" on some \"חדש\" tracks and small text, which I didn't read.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- On the first rows I never saw which company they belong to. The company name is cut off between screen 1 and screen 2. So the first S&P track, the one with 13.7%, I don't know whose it is.\n- Too many rows look the same, and nothing on the page tells me which one is good for me.\n- Lots of \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where I wanted a number.\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"מט\"ח\" next to מניות, and the coloured rings: I guessed teal means stocks, yellow means foreign currency\n- \"ההפקדה\" under the fee\n- \"קופה\" numbers\n- \"חשיפה\"\n- \"סטייה\" in the small print, which I skipped anyway"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1994,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1994},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da58d27b-d437-4b25-871a-dfa3ffd58130","uuid":"461dcfd5-e155-4be9-bb0d-d460728d30a5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:24:19.174Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfkL8Zu1aZwNEfhRHuU"}
